    "en": "Table STUDENT(RollNo, SName, Gender, City, Marks) has 6 rows: (1, Asha, F, Mysuru, 85), (2, Ravi, M, Hubballi, 72), (3, Meena, F, Mysuru, 91), (4, Kiran, M, Mangaluru, NULL), (5, Arjun, M, Mysuru, 64), (6, Divya, F, Hubballi, 78). Write queries for: (a) students with marks above 75, highest first; (b) names starting with A; (c) students whose marks are missing."
